{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Making chocolate has never been easier!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf6b Take a large cocoa bean and roast it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd28 Grind it into a rich, flavorful liquor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd5b Mix with milk and sugar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf21\ufe0f Temper it to perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf6c Pour into your favorite mold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf80 Wrap it with care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 Now it's ready to sell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a cozy and relaxing atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory and grow or purchase fresh ingredients</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your chocolate shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tools and appliances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the village and play minigames in neighboring stores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into sweet new worlds to discover unique recipes</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971550?t=1767696721","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971550?t=1767696721","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971550/c48ed5941ac7edf9fd5df1abebfabc6ebed59dda/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767696721","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971550/c48ed5941ac7edf9fd5df1abebfabc6ebed59dda/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767696721","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_suppo